seTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'MOTA 55.6': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The MOTA (Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy) score of 55.6 achieved by FastPose-MobileNet-v2 on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'mAP 63.1': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The mAP (mean Average Precision) score of 63.1 achieved by FastPose-18 on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'MOTA 56.8': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The MOTA (Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy) score of 56.8 achieved by FastPose-18 on the PoseTrack dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'mAP 89.38': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The mAP (mean Average Precision) score of 89.38 achieved by MTN on the SSM dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'Deeper backbone models': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The use of deeper backbone models is mentioned as a way to improve FastPose performance.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'FPS': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Frames per second, a measure of speed.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'optical flow estimation': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A technique used in FlowTrack-152.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'FastPose-50': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific version of the FastPose method.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'FastPose-101': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific version of the FastPose method.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'FlowTrack-152': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific version of the FlowTrack method.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'PoseTrack val': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['The validation split of the PoseTrack dataset, used for evaluating the performance of the FastPose framework and other methods.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'FlowTrack-50': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A human detector that achieves a MOTA of 62.9.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'Real-time inference': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The ability of FastPose to perform pose tracking in real-time.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'MOTA of 56.6': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The MOTA (Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy) score achieved by FastPose-50 on the PoseTrack test dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'MOTA of 57.4': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The MOTA (Multiple Object Tracking Accuracy) score achieved by FastPose-101 on the PoseTrack test dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'Tracking': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['One of the tasks integrated by MTN in the FastPose framework.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'Multi-task network (MTN)': {'description': ['An end-to-end network designed to perform human detection, pose estimation, and person re-identification tasks simultaneously.', 'A neural network architecture that jointly optimizes multiple tasks.', 'A network designed to predict bounding boxes, keypoint coordinates, and Re-ID features in a scene.', 'A multi-task network that integrates pose estimation and tracking tasks.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2, 11, 5]}, 'Human detection': {'description': ['The task of identifying and locating humans within an image or video.', 'A task performed by the head networks, involving bounding-box classification and regression.'], 'type': ['task'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2, 6, 7, 11]}, 'Pose estimation': {'description': ['The task of estimating the pose of a person, typically by identifying keypoints such as joints.', 'The task of estimating the pose of a person in an image or video.', 'A task performed by the head networks, aiming to determine the pose of a person.', 'The process of determining the pose of a person in an image or video.', 'Evaluated on COCO and PoseTrack datasets.', 'The task of estimating the pose of a person or object.', 'The task of identifying the position of body parts in images or videos.', 'The objective of determining the positions of human body keypoints.',